# Example HTTP Requests for QR Code Generator API

## Base URL
Replace with your deployed URL:
- Local: `http://localhost:3000`
- Production: `https://qr.tomaseu.pw`

---

## Basic QR Generation

### Simple text
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=Hello%20World" --output qr.png
```

### URL (properly encoded)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=https%3A%2F%2Fgoogle.com" --output qr.png
```

### URL with custom size
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com&size=512" --output qr.png
```

---

## Format Options

### SVG output
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=https://example.com&format=svg" --output qr.svg
```

### PNG output (default)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=https://example.com&format=png" --output qr.png
```

---

## Error Correction Levels

### Low (7%) - smallest QR
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&errorCorrectionLevel=L" --output qr.png
```

### Medium (15%) - default
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&errorCorrectionLevel=M" --output qr.png
```

### Quartile (25%)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&errorCorrectionLevel=Q" --output qr.png
```

### High (30%) - most robust
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&errorCorrectionLevel=H" --output qr.png
```

### Using ecl alias
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&ecl=H" --output qr.png
```

---

## Margin / Quiet Zone

### No margin (minimal quiet zone)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&margin=0" --output qr.png
```

### Default margin (4 modules)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&margin=4" --output qr.png
```

### Large margin
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&margin=10" --output qr.png
```

---

## Custom Colors

### Dark blue on light gray
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&color.dark=%231a1a2e&color.light=%23f5f5f5" --output qr.png
```

### Red on white
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&color.dark=%23ff0000" --output qr.png
```

### White on black (inverted)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&color.dark=%23ffffff&color.light=%23000000" --output qr.png
```

### Green on yellow
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&color.dark=%2300ff00&color.light=%23ffff00" --output qr.png
```

### Using aliases
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=data&dark=%23123456&light=%23abcdef" --output qr.png
```

---

## Special Data Types

### Email (mailto:)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=mailto%3Atest%40example.com" --output qr.png
```

### Email with subject/body
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=mailto%3Atest%40example.com%3Fsubject%3DHello%26body%3DTest%20message" --output qr.png
```

### Phone (tel:)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=tel%3A%2B421900123456" --output qr.png
```

### SMS
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=sms%3A%2B421900123456" --output qr.png
```

### WiFi (Android/iOS)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=WIFI%3AT%3AWPA%3BS%3AMyNetwork%3BP%3Apassword123%3B%3B" --output qr.png
```

### vCard
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=BEGIN%3AVCARD%0AVERSION%3A3.0%0AFN%3AJohn%20Doe%0ATEL%3A%2B421900123456%0AEMAIL%3Ajohn%40example.com%0AEND%3AVCARD" --output qr.png
```

### Geo location
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=geo%3A48.1482%2C17.1067" --output qr.png
```

---

## Unicode & Special Characters

### Unicode text
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=Hello%20%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%20%F0%9F%8C%8D" --output qr.png
```

### Emoji
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=%F0%9F%98%80%F0%9F%98%83%F0%9F%98%84" --output qr.png
```

### Special URL characters
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fpath%3Fquery%3Dvalue%26other%3D123%23fragment" --output qr.png
```

---

## Combined Options

### Maximum customization
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=https://example.com&size=512&format=png&errorCorrectionLevel=H&margin=2&color.dark=%231a1a2e&color.light=%23f5f5f5" --output qr.png
```

### Large SVG with high error correction
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=complex-data&size=1024&format=svg&errorCorrectionLevel=H" --output qr.svg
```

---

## Health & Info Endpoints

### Health check
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/health"
```

### API documentation (HTML)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/"
```

### API documentation (JSON)
```bash
curl -H "Accept: application/json" "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/"
```

---

## Error Cases (for testing)

### Missing text parameter
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Empty text
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text="
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Invalid size (too small)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=test&size=32"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Invalid size (too large)
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=test&size=2048"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Invalid format
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=test&format=jpg"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Invalid error correction
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=test&errorCorrectionLevel=X"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Invalid color
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=test&color.dark=red"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Same foreground/background
```bash
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=test&color.dark=%23ff0000&color.light=%23ff0000"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Oversized input
```bash
# Generate 3000+ char string
curl "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=$(python3 -c 'print("a"*3000)')"
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
```

### Wrong HTTP method
```bash
curl -X POST "https://qr.tomaseu.pw/qr?text=test"
# Expected: 405 Method Not Allowed
```

